  "public_warning": "CMS 2024 Hospital Service Area data show that 11,586,529 of 13,330,468 classified observable matched inpatient cases used a hospital in a different ZIP from the beneficiary mailing ZIP. That is observed cross-ZIP inpatient flow—not emergency flow, a county crossing, travel time, burden, or access failure. HLT, the $813.727B target, and both rate schedules remain unchanged."
